&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in fraud, risk, or management roles, including at least 2 years of directly leading and developing high-performing teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong strategic-thinking and problem-solving skills, with the ability to translate complex challenges into actionable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder-management skills, with the ability to influence and collaborate across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for delivering a user-centric experience while effectively managing risk.&lt;/li&gt;
