&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll be the go-to expert for your business area. You’ll partner directly with leaders within the SDC and be their go-to for all things data, insights, and strategy. You’ll be hands-on and responsible for delivering critical insights, ensuring data driven decision making is at the core of what we do. You’ll partner with leadership to drive business strategy, planning, goal-setting and performance tracking. You may also scope and lead mission critical projects and execute on strategic initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
