&lt;p&gt;Reporting to our Sr. Director of Enterprise Sales, you will map to a dedicated enterprise client under the Federal Financials umbrella.&amp;nbsp; You will come with an informed point of view on Big Data, Advanced Analytics, and AI, which will help to guide your successful execution strategy and allow you to provide genuine value to the client&lt;/p&gt;
