&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;P-1628&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Databricks is one of the world&#39;s fastest-growing data and AI companies, transforming how organisations harness the power of their data. As we continue to scale across India, we&#39;re looking for an experienced and forward-thinking &lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Real Estate &amp;amp; Workplace Services – India&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our workplace operations and employee experience across Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Real Estate &amp;amp; Workplace Services (REWS) team operates in a fast-paced, constantly evolving environment. We&#39;re looking for a leader who brings a startup mindset, combines strategic thinking with operational excellence, and is passionate about creating workplaces where our employees can do their best work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will have end-to-end accountability for workplace services across India, with Bangalore serving as our largest operational hub. You&#39;ll be responsible for creating an exceptional, consistent employee experience while ensuring our workplaces are safe, efficient, financially responsible and positioned to support the next phase of Databricks&#39; growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will lead and develop our local workplace teams, oversee our outsourced Integrated Facilities Management (IFM) partners, and build strong relationships across the business. Beyond delivering excellent day-to-day operations, you&#39;ll be expected to anticipate future needs, challenge existing ways of working and introduce scalable processes, data-driven insights and AI-enabled solutions that improve how we operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible leadership role requiring someone who can navigate complex operational challenges, influence senior stakeholders, and balance the needs of a rapidly growing business with long-term operational sustainability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The position is based in Bangalore, with regular travel to Mumbai and Delhi and occasional international travel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Outcomes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and execute the workplace services strategy across Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi, ensuring our workplaces support business growth, operational excellence and an exceptional employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead all aspects of workplace operations, including facilities, catering, hospitality, amenities and employee services, ensuring consistent standards, efficiency and accountability across the portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, coach and develop a high-performing workplace team, creating a culture of ownership, collaboration and continuous improvement while planning for future growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create welcoming, inclusive and engaging workplaces that reflect Databricks&#39; culture, using employee feedback and data to continuously elevate services and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own strategic supplier relationships, including IFM and catering partners, driving performance, innovation, commercial value and service excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own India workplace budgets, forecasting and financial performance, identifying opportunities to optimise costs, improve productivity and deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior business leaders and cross-functional teams, influencing decisions, aligning priorities and proactively managing complex operational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Real Estate, Design &amp;amp; Construction and other stakeholders to support office expansions, relocations and operational transitions, ensuring workplaces are ready to scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure all workplaces meet local regulatory and health and safety requirements, and maintain strong governance, risk management, and business continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion data-driven decision-making, AI and automation to simplify processes, improve operational performance and create scalable ways of working.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in workplace services, facilities management, real estate operations or hospitality, ideally within a fast-growing global technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading multi-site workplace operations, with strong knowledge of the Indian market, particularly Bangalore, Mumbai and Delhi.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to develop and execute workplace strategies, manage complex operational challenges and drive measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong people leadership experience, with a track record of building, coaching and developing high-performing teams, including outsourced service partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing large-scale workplace operations, including facilities, catering, hospitality, employee experience and workplace services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial and commercial acumen, including budget ownership, forecasting, cost optimisation, procurement and contract management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage strategic vendor relationships, particularly Integrated Facilities Management (IFM) providers, driving service excellence, accountability and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to influence senior leadership, navigate competing priorities and work effectively across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of Indian workplace regulations, health and safety, statutory compliance and operational risk management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised and comfortable managing multiple priorities, complex projects and competing deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven and solutions-focused mindset, with experience using operational metrics, technology, AI and automation to improve efficiency and service delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A customer-focused approach with a passion for hospitality, employee experience and consistently delivering high-quality workplace services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting office expansions, relocations, workplace mobilisation and change management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with Google Workspace and collaborative workplace management tools; experience with Asana, Freshservice and similar platforms preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, adaptable leader with a startup mindset, strong judgment and the confidence to operate independently while knowing when to escalate or challenge decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
