&lt;p&gt;At Databricks, we are passionate about helping enterprises that build ML models and AI agents deliver high-quality AI to production fast. Founded by engineers, and customer obsessed, we leap at every opportunity to tackle technical challenges, from designing great developer experiences to building reliable systems at global scale. And we&#39;re only getting started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team builds the MLOps and LLMOps platform that millions of AI developers and ML practitioners use to track model training experiments, manage model registry, observe and evaluate AI agents. We&#39;re the team behind &lt;a href=&quot;https://mlflow.org/&quot;&gt;MLflow&lt;/a&gt;, the most widely adopted open-source AI engineering platform with more than 30 million package downloads per month, and its managed service used by thousands of organizations globally. We&#39;re now expanding to Bengaluru, India, and building our first AI engineering team there from scratch to work on this platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; and a founding member of the Bengaluru team, you&#39;ll design and build the backend systems behind these products and take them from design through production. This is an excellent opportunity for a hands-on engineer who thrives in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out our recent blog post: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.databricks.com/blog/costar-how-we-ship-ai-agents-databricks-fast-without-breaking-things&quot;&gt;coSTAR: How we ship AI agents at Databricks fast, without breaking things&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement core services and APIs for the platform, ensuring scalability, reliability, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build systems that ingest, store, and query traces, metrics, and artifacts from training runs and production agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop evaluation and monitoring capabilities, such as LLM judges and quality metrics, that catch regressions before they reach production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize the scalability and cost of the platform as usage grows across customers and cloud regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product, research, and customers on what we build next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish best practices for code quality, testing, and operational readiness, and mentor other engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS (or higher) in Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing large-scale distributed systems, scaling infrastructure, or building platforms and developer tools for other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in algorithms, data structures, and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with backend technical stacks such as Scala or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud technologies, e.g. AWS, Azure, GCP, Docker, Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering maturity in security, correctness, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and ability to collaborate across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML or LLM systems is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
