&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience developing large-scale distributed systems, scaling infrastructure, or building platforms and developer tools for other teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong foundation in algorithms, data structures, and system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with backend technical stacks such as Scala or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud technologies, e.g. AWS, Azure, GCP, Docker, Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering maturity in security, correctness, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record as a technical lead, driving architecture decisions and delivering complex, high-impact projects end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead through influence across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and a passion for mentoring engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ML or LLM systems is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
