&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong verbal and written communication skills, problem-solving skills, attention to detail, and interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Must be proactive with proven ability to learn fast and execute on multiple tasks simultaneously&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to manage Microsoft Excel and Google Sheets&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
