&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Multi-lingual; experience working with infrastructure in multiple countries&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfortable with remote “lights-out” and out-of-band access to data center resources&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Linux certifications (RHCSA etc.)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Network certifications (CCNA, JNCIA or higher)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
