&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scripting or software development experience in Bash, Python or Go-lang&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with load balancing and reverse proxies such as Nginx, Varnish, HAProxy, Apache&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in working within a large scale SaaS vendor&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
