&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Denver based hires: Estimated annual salary of 93,000 - 128,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Seattle based hires: Estimated annual salary of 104,000 - 143,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For Washington D.C. based hires: Estimated annual salary of 104,000 - 143,000 USD&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
