&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;For SF, SJ, and Bay Area Metro based hires: Estimated annual salary of $138,000 - $190,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;For Boston, California - Remote, Connecticut - Remote, DC Metro, Massachusetts - Remote, New Jersey - Remote, New York City, NY Metro, Remote - Washington, Washington (Kirkland), and Washington D.C. based hires: Estimated annual salary of $132,000 - $182,000.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; vertical-align: middle; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;&quot;&gt;For Colorado - Remote, Illinois - Remote, Maryland - Remote, Minnesota - Remote, Nevada - Remote, New York - Remote, Rhode Island - Remote, and Vermont - Remote based hires: Estimated annual base salary of $120,000 - $165,000.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
