&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare’s Hardware Team is hiring a Systems Engineer, with a firmware focus, in the U.S. to help deliver the Hardware team’s security goals and projects in 2027 &amp;amp; beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
