&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For SF based hires: Estimated annual salary of $221,000 - $304,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;For NY based hires: Estimated annual salary of $211,000 - $290,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
