&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we’re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap; we’re looking for the builders who see the cracks in the Internet that everyone else has simply learned to live with. We value candidates who have the instinct to spot a &quot;normalized&quot; problem and the AI-native curiosity to create a solution using the latest tools. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to ship faster today to make it better tomorrow, while ensuring that every improvement, no matter how small, is shared across the team to lift everyone up. If you’re the type of person who values curiosity over bureaucracy, and that AI is a partner in solving tough problems to keep the Internet moving forward, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available Locations: &lt;/strong&gt;Austin, Texas&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Created in January 2025, our centralized Developer Go-to-Market (GTM) organization functions as a &quot;speedboat&quot; to maintain focus, control direction, and iterate quickly. Our mission is to build long-term relationships with developers by addressing their unique needs and challenges with specialized attention and resources.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team operates across four core pillars: Marketing, Developer Relations, Growth Programs, and Sales. These functions work in close collaboration to support customers throughout their journey, from raising awareness and inspiring new use cases to driving platform adoption, consumption, and scaling customer relationships. Each function amplifies the impact of the others through strategic partnerships and shared insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the GTM-facing software and data products our sales motion runs on, end to end. That includes the data foundation underneath it and the signals that flag which accounts a rep should act on and when. You&#39;ll also lead our hardest cross-functional projects, the ones that span many teams and systems. You&#39;ll drive them to delivery, keep partner teams on track, and do it with a lot of autonomy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Day to day you&#39;ll improve how we visualize pipeline, build sales tools that flag the right moment to reach out to a customer, and make the developer buying journey smoother. The work is a mix of data engineering, full-stack product, and applied AI, and you&#39;ll build it on Cloudflare&#39;s own developer platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role fits someone who works well in a fast-paced, ambiguous environment, likes turning messy business problems into working software, and can juggle several priorities at once.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement features in a Golang, Typescript and SQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate production services on Cloudflare Workers and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the data foundation including Query Engine, Workflows, MCP/APIs and other internal facing products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end to end; from design docs and schema changes through implementation, testing, deployment, and production monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in on call rotations, drive incident resolution, and write postmortems that improve reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools extensively to accelerate development, debugging, and operational tasks. We expect engineers to leverage AI as a core part of their workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across teams to coordinate capacity planning, API contracts, and cross cutting initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed with Sales, Marketing, Developer Relations (DevRel), and Growth to turn fuzzy operational pain into shipped software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help set the standard for GTM engineering organization wide.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Skills, Knowledge, and Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Cloudflare, we know that great candidates come from diverse backgrounds with non-linear paths. You don’t need to tick every single box to be right for this role. If you are excited about building a better Internet and ready to make an impact, please apply.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of software engineering experience with a demonstrated history of leading complex, organization-wide data initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in building distributed systems and production infrastructure at scale, with proficiency in Go and strong working knowledge of TypeScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional ability to navigate ambiguous problem spaces, identify the highest-impact technical work, and drive projects autonomously from conception through adoption—balancing pragmatic execution with long-term technical excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep analytical SQL and data modeling experience. Proven ability to manage complexity even at thousands of tables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to debug database and query performance issues using profiling tools and source code where applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Please be prepared to discuss specific examples of organization-wide technical initiatives you&#39;ve led, particularly distributed systems or data infrastructure and their measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Principal Engineer, Staff+ engineer, or technical leader on platform, infrastructure, or task force teams that operate outside traditional product roadmaps with a focus on enabling GTM organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Columnar/OLAP or lakehouse experience (ClickHouse, DuckDB, BigQuery, Snowflake, Iceberg, Starrocks).Familiarity with the Salesforce data model and CRM/API integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with deploying to bare metal and Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience on Cloudflare Workers / edge platforms and analytics-engineering (dbt) workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in SaaS or product-led growth (PLG) GTM motions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare’s equity plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloudflare offers a complete package of benefits and programs to support you and your family.&amp;nbsp; Our benefits programs can help you pay health care expenses, support caregiving, build capital for the future and make life a little easier and fun!&amp;nbsp; The below is a description of our benefits for employees in the United States, and benefits may vary for employees based outside the U.S.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Welfare Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical/Rx Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vision Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Spending Accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter Spending Accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fertility &amp;amp; Family Forming Benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On-demand mental health support and Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Travel Medical Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Short and Long Term Disability Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life &amp;amp; Accident Insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) Retirement Savings Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Participation Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off covering vacation and sick leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leave programs, including parental, pregnancy health, medical, and bereavement leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;What Makes Cloudflare Special?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We’re not just a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company. We’re a highly ambitious, large-scale technology company with a soul. Fundamental to our mission to help build a better Internet is protecting the free and open Internet.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.cloudflare.com/protecting-free-expression-online/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project Galileo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: Since 2014, we&#39;ve equipped more than 2,400 journalism and civil society organizations in 111 countries with powerful tools to defend themselves against attacks that would otherwise censor their work, technology already used by Cloudflare’s enterprise customers--at no cost.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cloudflare.com/athenian/&quot;&gt;Athenian Project&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: In 2017, we created the Athenian Project to ensure that state and local governments have the highest level of protection and reliability for free, so that their constituents have access to election information and voter registration. Since the project, we&#39;ve provided services to more than 425 local government election websites in 33 states.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1.1.1.1/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.1.1.1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: We released&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://1.1.1.1/&quot;&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;1.1.1.1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; to help fix the foundation of the Internet by building a faster, more secure and privacy-centric public DNS resolver. This is available publicly for everyone to use - it is the first consumer-focused service Cloudflare has ever released. Here’s the deal - we don’t store client IP addresses never, ever. We will continue to abide by our&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://developers.cloudflare.com/1.1.1.1/privacy/public-dns-resolver&quot;&gt; privacy commitment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and ensure that no user data is sold to advertisers or used to target consumers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Sound like something you’d like to be a part of? We’d love to hear from you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Please note that applicants who progress to the offer stage of the interview process may be asked to attend an in-person interview within one of the Cloudflare Offices or Cloudflare Hubs.&amp;nbsp; More details about this will be available at that stage of the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;This position may require access to information protected under U.S. export control laws, including the U.S. Export Administration Regulations. Please note that any offer of employment may be conditioned on your authorization to receive software or technology controlled under these U.S. export laws without sponsorship for an export license.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Cloudflare is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. &amp;nbsp;We are committed to providing equal employment opportunity for all people and place great value in both diversity and inclusiveness. &amp;nbsp;All qualified applicants will be considered for employment without regard to their, or any other person&#39;s, perceived or actual&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;race, color, religion, sex, gender, gender identity, gender expression, sexual orientation, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, medical condition, family care status, or any other basis protected by law. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We are an AA/Veterans/Disabled Employer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Cloudflare provides reasonable accommodations to qualified individuals with disabilities. &amp;nbsp;Please tell us if you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job. Examples of reasonable accommodations include, but are not limited to, changing the application process, providing documents in an alternate format, using a sign language interpreter, or using specialized equipment. &amp;nbsp;If you require a reasonable accommodation to apply for a job, please contact us via e-mail at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;hr@cloudflare.com&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; or via mail at 101 Townsend St. San Francisco, CA 94107.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we are on a mission to help build a better Internet. Today the company runs one of the world’s largest networks that powers millions of websites and other Internet properties for customers ranging from individual bloggers to SMBs to Fortune 500 companies. Cloudflare protects and accelerates any Internet application online without adding hardware, installing software, or changing a line of code. Internet properties powered by Cloudflare all have web traffic routed through its intelligent global network, which gets smarter with every request. As a result, they see significant improvement in performance and a decrease in spam and other attacks. Cloudflare was named to Entrepreneur Magazine’s Top Company Cultures list and ranked among the World’s Most Innovative Companies by Fast Company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Cloudflare, we’re not looking for people who wait for a polished roadmap; we’re looking for the builders who see the cracks in the Internet that everyone else has simply learned to live with. We value candidates who have the instinct to spot a &quot;normalized&quot; problem and the AI-native curiosity to create a solution using the latest tools. Our culture is built on iteration, leveraging AI to ship faster today to make it better tomorrow, while ensuring that every improvement, no matter how small, is shared across the team to lift everyone up. If you’re the type of person who values curiosity over bureaucracy, and that AI is a partner in solving tough problems to keep the Internet moving forward, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Available Locations: Austin, TX, San Francisco CA, NYC, Denver, OR Remote US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a highly capable, hands-on operator to join the Office of the President of Revenue at Cloudflare.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This person will work directly with the Revenue Chief of Staff to help run the business, drive executive priorities, and ensure the GTM organization stays aligned and informed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The right person is someone who sees what needs to be done and takes ownership without waiting for direction. They can move between strategy and execution, navigate ambiguity, manage competing priorities, and work effectively with senior leaders across the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-visibility role that requires strong judgment, exceptional follow-through, and the ability to move quickly without sacrificing quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have a front-row seat to how a global revenue organization operates, with the opportunity to make a meaningful impact across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Business Operations &amp;amp; Executive Priorities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the Revenue Chief of Staff to drive priorities across the Office of the President of Revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an extension of the Revenue Chief of Staff, representing the office in cross-functional meetings and independently driving decisions and follow-through within agreed priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate upcoming needs, identify gaps, and proactively drive work forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare executive-ready updates, briefing materials, presentations, and communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track decisions, commitments, and dependencies, ensuring the right people are accountable and work moves forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help manage competing priorities, bringing recommendations and solutions rather than simply escalating problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM Communications &amp;amp; Engagement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the execution and quality of GTM-wide communications, including the weekly GTM Rollup, leadership updates, and organizational announcements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across functions to gather, validate, prioritize, and translate information into clear, actionable communications for the field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive planning and execution of GTM leadership engagement programs, including All Hands and Leadership Unplugged, from content development and stakeholder coordination through delivery and follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with executive stakeholders and content owners to ensure messaging is relevant, engaging, and aligned with GTM priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure communications are accurate, timely, and appropriate for their intended audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve how information reaches the field, reducing unnecessary noise while making important updates easier to find and act on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Field Advisory Board (FAB) Program Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve Cloudflare&#39;s global Field Advisory Board (FAB) program, ensuring it serves as a meaningful two-way feedback channel between field teams and GTM leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the Americas and International boards, including member engagement, quarterly meetings, agendas, executive participation, and follow-through on commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales, Product, Enablement, Revenue Operations, and other teams to turn field feedback into actionable recommendations and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify recurring themes, challenges, and opportunities from the field, and bring forward insights that help inform GTM priorities and decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strengthen the program&#39;s effectiveness by improving how feedback is collected, prioritized, communicated, and acted upon.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure FAB members see tangible outcomes from their input, building trust and sustained engagement in the program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish clear measures of program impact and regularly assess what&#39;s working, what&#39;s not, and where the program needs to evolve.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives that span Sales, Revenue Operations, Marketing, Product, Enablement, and other functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate FAB objectives into clear actions, owners, and timelines, and ensure commitments are delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify risks and dependencies early, recommend solutions, and escalate when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships across the organization and influence outcomes without formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Step into ambiguous or urgent situations and bring structure, clarity, and momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance the needs of multiple stakeholders while keeping the broader GTM organization&#39;s priorities in focus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational Excellence &amp;amp; Scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify processes, eliminate unnecessary work, and improve how the GTM organization operates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI, automation, and internal tools to reduce manual effort and improve execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create lightweight systems for tracking priorities, decisions, and follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish practical quality-control processes to ensure work is accurate and complete before delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve the quality, consistency, and efficiency of work coming out of the Office of the President of Revenue.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of experience in business operations, GTM strategy and operations, executive operations, Chief of Staff support, or similar roles in a fast-paced technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience working with senior executives and navigating complex, cross-functional organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently own programs or initiatives from planning through execution, including driving stakeholder alignment and measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional organizational skills and attention to detail, with a track record of managing multiple priorities without losing sight of the details.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, including the ability to turn complex information into clear, concise, executive-ready materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent judgment and the confidence to make recommendations, challenge assumptions, and know when to escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset. You don&#39;t wait to be told what to do, and you&#39;re comfortable taking ownership of problems that don&#39;t have obvious answers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong execution skills. You follow through, close loops, and take responsibility for outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with ambiguity, changing priorities, and tight timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI and automation to improve productivity and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A low-ego, collaborative approach and willingness to roll up your sleeves, regardless of the task.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within your first six months:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve become a trusted extension of the Revenue Chief of Staff, able to independently represent the office and move work forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GTM communications and leadership engagement programs run smoothly, with strong quality control and minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Field Advisory Board operates as an effective, trusted feedback mechanism, with strong member engagement, actionable insights, and visible progress against field recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You anticipate needs, identify potential issues, and bring solutions before problems escalate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-functional stakeholders trust you to drive decisions, follow through on commitments, and keep work moving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve identified and implemented meaningful improvements to how the team operates, including opportunities to use AI and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Revenue Chief of Staff has more capacity to focus on strategic priorities because you&#39;re independently managing critical aspects of the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who Will Thrive Here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re naturally curious, resourceful, and comfortable figuring things out. You care about doing great work, but you don&#39;t need perfect instructions or a perfect process to get started.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can operate at the executive level and still enjoy the details. You know when to ask questions, when to push back, and when to just get something done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You enjoy building relationships, connecting the dots across teams, and finding ways to make things work better. You&#39;re comfortable taking the lead, even when you don&#39;t have formal authority, and you take ownership of the outcome.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Most importantly, you take pride in being someone others can count on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;first-token&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Application Deadline:&lt;/strong&gt; January 31, 2027&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Compensation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;Compensation may be adjusted depending on work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;For SF, SJ, and Bay Area Metro based hires: Estimated annual salary of $174,000 - $240,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;For Boston, California - Remote, Connecticut - Remote, DC Metro, Massachusetts - Remote, New Jersey - Remote, New York City, NY Metro, Remote - Washington, Washington (Kirkland), and Washington D.C. based hires: Estimated annual salary of $166,000 - $228,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;For Colorado - Remote, Illinois - Remote, Maryland - Remote, Minnesota - Remote, Nevada - Remote, New York - Remote, Rhode Island - Remote, and Vermont - Remote based hires: Estimated annual salary of $143,000 - $197,000.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;&quot; data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Equity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare&#39;s equity plan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
