&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The estimated annual salary range for the Bay Area is: $157,000 - $216,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;This role is eligible to participate in Cloudflare’s equity plan.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
