&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 8 years of experience in professional services, practice architecture or leadership roles, or a developer oriented customer-facing role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the professional services landscape, including both internal and partner-provided services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of development platforms and frameworks and how they can benefit customers. In particular being able to translate business challenges into a developer platform based solution or partial solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly prototype potential solutions for customers and then provide guidance on the migration from prototype to robust business critical application/solutions should occur.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrable desire to educate fellow professional services staff how to leverage developer platform capabilities within their practice, respectively being Zero Trust Networking and Application services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent prior work experience as a Product Manager, Practice Manager or Architect&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge and familiarity with the Software Development Life Cycle&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated progressive relevant experience defining, developing, and executing training strategies, operations and action plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly understand technical concepts and explain them to customer and professional services audiences (mostly technical)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to effectively interact with and influence senior executives and team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communication, negotiation, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in giving and receiving constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a fast-paced, unpredictable environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of how the Internet works, Networking and Security, Zero Trust Services/SASE, DNS, TCP/IP, HTTP, TLS, APIs and related technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Jira and Salesforce (or similar CRM tool) is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English (written and oral) is a must. Fluency in one or more additional regional languages is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing and managing content delivery network (CDN), distributed denial-of-service (DDoS) protection, web application firewall (WAF), load balancing, and other related solutions for clients across various industries.&lt;/li&gt;
