&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;For New York City, New Jersey, Washington, Washington DC, and California (excluding Bay Area) based hires: Estimated annual salary of $185,000 - $254,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
