&lt;div&gt;Manage complex contract negotiations for high-AOV, multi-product enterprise deals&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Maintain a robust sales pipeline through proactive outbound targeting and whitespace mining within your installed base&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Develop long-term strategic relationships with key accounts to convert variable usage into committed enterprise contracts&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Collaborate closely with the regional partner ecosystem (e.g., Tech Data, Softcell) to accelerate deal velocity&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;lt; 50% travel&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
