&lt;div&gt;Fluent in English&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Relevant direct experience, track record, and relationships within corporate enterprise accounts in the India market (specifically Karnataka and South India)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Minimum 10 years of direct B2B selling experience, preferably managing internet, cloud, and security accounts&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Direct experience selling network security, Zero Trust/SASE (Cloudflare One), and/or CDN / Application Security solutions preferred&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven track record of executing competitive takeout campaigns against legacy hardware and cloud point solutions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
