&lt;div&gt;Strong interpersonal communication (verbal and written) and organisational skills&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Self-motivated; entrepreneurial spirit&lt;/div&gt;
